          <change when="2013-12-18T09:15:33.019-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/berkes.lajos">Vote - AcceptText - Convincing correction, the traces fit the new reading better and the parallels are clear. But =&gt; &lt;:&lt;:&lt;#τεσσαρεσ4.- [καιδεκάτης]=14#&gt;|reg|&lt;#δεσ̣σ̣ε̣ρ̣ε̣σ̣ 4.- [καιδεκάτης]=14#&gt;:&gt;=; This correction has also implications for the possible dating of the papyrus. Shouldn't that be noted? </change>
